---
// The small Blanc lockup (docs/brand-usage.md → Blanc lockup): the Sunrise
// mark beside the Text cut of the outlined word, 90×22px. Used by the site
// header and the What's New header; placement lives in revamp.css.
---
<span class="site-lockup site-lockup--small" aria-hidden="true"
  ><img
    class="site-lockup-mark"
    src="/lockup/sunrise-mark-256.webp"
    width="256"
    height="256"
    alt=""
  /><img
    class="site-lockup-word"
    src="/lockup/blanc-word-small-ink.svg"
    width="2466"
    height="762"
    alt=""
  /></span
>
